    "description": {
      "value": "<p>你选择极地作为大地结社的地形。达到表中等级时，获得对应的结社法术。这些法术始终准备，不计入你的每日准备法术上限，对你而言视为德鲁伊法术。</p>\n<table> <thead><tr> <th> <p><strong>德鲁伊等级</strong></p> </th> <th> <p><strong>结社法术</strong></p> </th> </tr> </thead><tbody><tr> <td> <p>3rd</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.syHHJlRPS4rVwCQA]{人类定身术}</em><em>hold person</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.1oL8DBOVZMuhaKpw]{荆棘丛生}</em><em>spike growth</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>5th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.InxRn0MsZsH5wslj]{雪雨暴}</em><em>sleet storm</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.2AgiR8EQ7IglGbci]{缓慢术}</em><em>slow</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>7th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.OZMc9g7XaWuRc36J]{行动自如}</em><em>freedom of movement</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.u2MG84qW8YLuECHa]{冰风暴}</em><em>ice storm</em></p> </td> </tr> <tr> <td> <p>9th</p> </td> <td> <p><em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.tnDSVQwVqkmqWFPP]{问道自然}</em><em>commune with nature</em><em>，@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.z9HXB89B3uO5NHW8]{寒冰锥}</em><em>cone of cold</em></p> </td> </tr> </tbody></table>",
